## 16. Data Exposure Policy

### Public Integration Data (API response에 포함)

- Server identity (server_id, vendor, model, hostname, serial_number, service_tag)
- Hardware inventory (CPU, Memory, GPU, Storage, Network)
- Management info (controller type, firmware version, protocols)
- OS info (distribution, version, kernel, architecture)
- Virtualization info (KVM, virsh, VM count)
- Container info (Docker, Kubernetes)
- Development environment (git, python, node, npm, gcc, pm2)
- Compute info (potential, eligibility, capabilities)
- Health (per-component health status)
- Workload (CPU/memory utilization, load average)
- Power/Thermal (PSU, temperatures, fans)
- Verification summary (performed, success, discrepancy count)
- Snapshot history (summary)
- Diff results (field changes)

### Internal-Only Data (API response에 **절대** 포함하지 않음)

- Credentials (password, API key, SSH key, Redfish credential)
- Raw SSH command output
- Raw Redfish HTTP response
- Internal subprocess details
- Stack traces
- Internal file paths
- Database query strings
- SQLite implementation details
- Collector internal state
- Normalizer internal state

